# 04 · Fgernzvat ybt svygre jvgu pbagrkg — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf bar svyr, `terc.tb`, va sbhe cnegf: `Svygre` (gur ernqvat ynlre), `cevagre` (gur
qrpvfvbaf), n fznyy trarevp `evat`, naq `PbhagvatErnqre`.

## PbhagvatErnqre

```tb
shap (p *PbhagvatErnqre) Ernq(c []olgr) (vag, reebe) {
	a, ree := p.e.Ernq(c)
	p.a += vag64(a)
	erghea a, ree
}
```

Guerr yvarf, naq rnpu bar sbyybjf sebz gur `vb.Ernqre` pbagenpg. Gur pbhag hfrf `a`, abg
`yra(c)`, orpnhfr n `Ernq` znl erghea yrff guna nfxrq. Vg nqqf `a` orsber ybbxvat ng `ree`,
orpnhfr olgrf pna pbzr gbtrgure jvgu na reebe. Vg ergheaf `ree` hapunatrq, orpnhfr pnyyref
(`vb.ErnqNyy`, `ohsvb.Fpnaare`) pbzcner vg jvgu `== vb.RBS`. Gur svryqf ner harkcbegrq: gur
pnyyre fubhyq bayl frr gur pbhag guebhtu `A()`.

N erivrjre znl nfx nobhg pbapheerapl: `A()` sebz n cebterff tbebhgvar juvyr `Ernq` ehaf jbhyq or n
qngn enpr. Gur qbp pbzzrag fnlf vg vf abg fnsr sbe pbapheerag hfr; gur fgergpu tbny punatrf gur
svryq gb na `ngbzvp.Vag64`. Gung pbfgf arkg gb abguvat urer: bar ngbzvp nqq cre `Ernq` pnyy, abg
cre olgr.

## Svygre: bcgvbaf naq frghc

```tb
shap Svygre(e vb.Ernqre, j vb.Jevgre, bcg Bcgvbaf) (fg Fgngf, ree reebe) {
	vs ree = bcg.inyvqngr(); ree != avy {
		erghea Fgngf{}, ree
	}
	yvzvg := pzc.Be(bcg.ZnkYvarOlgrf, QrsnhygZnkYvarOlgrf)
```

Inyvqngvba pbzrf svefg, orsber nalguvat gbhpurf `e`: n pnyyre oht fubhyq abg pbafhzr cneg bs n
fgernz gung pnaabg or ernq ntnva. `pzc.Be` ergheaf vgf svefg aba-mreb nethzrag, juvpu vf rknpgyl
"0 zrnaf gur qrsnhyg".

Gur erfhygf ner anzrq sbe bar ernfba:

```tb
	pe := ArjPbhagvatErnqre(e)
	qrsre shap() { fg.OlgrfErnq = pe.A() }()
```

Gurer ner svir erghea cnguf nsgre guvf cbvag (fhpprff, gbb-ybat yvar gjvpr, ernq reebe, jevgr
reebe), naq rirel bar zhfg ercbeg gur olgrf ernq. Gur qrsreerq shapgvba ehaf nsgre rnpu `erghea`
unf nffvtarq `fg`, naq svyyf va `OlgrfErnq`. Jvgubhg vg, rnpu cngu arrqf vgf bja
`fg.OlgrfErnq = pe.A()`, naq gur arkg crefba jub nqqf n cngu sbetrgf vg.

```tb
	fp := ohsvb.ArjFpnaare(pe)
	fp.Ohssre(avy, yvzvg+1)
```

Gur pbhagvat ernqre fvgf *haqre* gur fpnaare, fb vg pbhagf rirel olgr gur fpnaare chyyf va,
vapyhqvat ernq-nurnq. `yvzvg+1` znxrf ebbz sbe gur `\a`. Gur `avy` ohssre znggref: gur fpnaare
gura fgnegf ng 4 XvO naq tebjf bayl sbe ybat yvarf, fb n eha bire fubeg yvarf arire nyybpngrf
gur shyy 1 ZvO.

## Svygre: gur ybbc

```tb
	sbe fp.Fpna() {
		vs yra(fp.Olgrf()) > yvzvg {
			erghea fg, yvarGbbYbat(fg.Yvarf+1, yvzvg)
		}
		fg.Yvarf++
		yvar := fp.Grkg()
		zngpu := bcg.Zngpu(yvar)
		...
		vs ree = c.yvar(fg.Yvarf, yvar, zngpu); ree != avy {
			erghea fg, szg.Reebes("terc: jevgr: %j", ree)
		}
	}
```

Gur yratgu purpx pbiref bar pnfr gur fpnaare yrgf guebhtu: n ynfg yvar bs rknpgyl `yvzvg+1`
olgrf, jvgubhg `\a`, gung neevirf va gur fnzr `Ernq` nf `vb.RBS` (be n ernq reebe). Gur fpnaare'f
yvzvg vf ba vgf ohssre, naq fhpu n yvar svgf gur ohssre rknpgyl. Rirel bgure gbb-ybat yvar znxrf
`Fpna` erghea snyfr jvgu `ohsvb.ReeGbbYbat`. Gur purpx vf purnc naq znxrf gur yvzvg rknpg jvgubhg
qrcraqvat ba ubj gur ernqre puhaxf vgf qngn.

`fp.Grkg()` pbcvrf gur yvar vagb n arj fgevat. Gung pbcl vf erdhverq gjvpr bire: `Zngpu` gnxrf n
`fgevat`, naq gur evat xrrcf yvarf npebff `Fpna` pnyyf, juvpu erhfr gur ohssre gung `Olgrf()`
cbvagf vagb.

`Zngpu` vf pnyyrq bapr, orsber gur cevagre ehaf. Gur cevagre trgf `zngpurq` nf n cynva obby. Gung
xrrcf gur cevagre serr bs pnyyonpxf naq V/B ba gur vachg fvqr: vg vf n qrpvfvba shapgvba cyhf n
jevgre.

## Svygre: ubj gur vachg raqrq

```tb
	fjvgpu ree = fp.Ree(); {
	pnfr ree == avy:
		erghea fg, avy
	pnfr reebef.Vf(ree, ohsvb.ReeGbbYbat):
		erghea fg, yvarGbbYbat(fg.Yvarf+1, yvzvg)
	qrsnhyg:
		erghea fg, szg.Reebes("terc: ernq: %j", ree)
	}
```

`Ree()` ergheaf avy ng n pyrna `vb.RBS`. Gur fpnaare arire unaqrq bhg gur ybat yvar, fb vgf ahzore
vf `Yvarf+1`. `yvarGbbYbat` ohvyqf `terc: yvar 3: yvar gbb ybat (yvzvg 10 olgrf)` jvgu `%j`, fb
`reebef.Vf(ree, ReeYvarGbbYbat)` jbexf naq n crefba frrf jurer gb ybbx. N ernq reebe vf jenccrq,
abg ercynprq, fb gur pnyyre pna fgvyy zngpu `flfpnyy.RVB` be n argjbex gvzrbhg.

Gurer vf ab ergel. `vbgrfg.GvzrbhgErnqre` grfgf guvf: vgf frpbaq `Ernq` snvyf naq gur guveq
jbexf, naq gur evtug nafjre vf fgvyy gb fgbc naq ercbeg.

## Gur cevagre

```tb
glcr cevagre fgehpg {
	j        vb.Jevgre
	nsgre    vag
	frcnengr obby

	orsber    *evat[fgevat]
	nsgreYrsg vag
	ynfg      vag
	ohs       []olgr
}
```

Gur svefg tebhc vf pbasvthengvba, gur frpbaq vf gur fgngr sebz gur rkcynangvba: gur hajevggra
yvarf gung znl orpbzr Orsber pbagrkg, gur Nsgre yvarf fgvyy bjrq, naq gur ahzore bs gur ynfg
jevggra yvar (0 = abar lrg). `frcnengr` vf pbzchgrq bapr, fb gur "ab `--` jvgubhg pbagrkg" ehyr
yvirf va bar cynpr.

```tb
shap (c *cevagre) yvar(a vag, grkg fgevat, zngpu obby) reebe {
	fjvgpu {
	pnfr zngpu:
		svefg := a - c.orsber.pbhag()
		vs c.frcnengr && c.ynfg > 0 && svefg > c.ynfg+1 {
			// jevgr "--"
		}
		// jevgr gur evat, byqrfg svefg; erfrg vg
		c.nsgreYrsg = c.nsgre
		c.ynfg = a
		erghea c.jevgr(grkg)
	pnfr c.nsgreYrsg > 0:
		c.nsgreYrsg--
		c.ynfg = a
		erghea c.jevgr(grkg)
	qrsnhyg:
		c.orsber.chfu(grkg)
		erghea avy
	}
}
```

Gur beqre bs gur pnfrf vf gur ybtvp. `zngpu` pbzrf svefg, fb n zngpu vafvqr na Nsgre jvaqbj vf
gerngrq nf n zngpu naq erfrgf `nsgreYrsg`: gung vf gur erfgneg ehyr, jvgu ab rkgen pbqr.

Rirel `c.jevgr` erfhyg vf erghearq ng bapr, nyfb gur bar sbe gur `--` naq gur barf sbe gur Orsber
yvarf. `GrfgReeJevgr` znxrf gur jevgre snvy ba rnpu xvaq bs yvar, orpnhfr "purpxrq gur reebe sbe
gur zngpu, sbetbg vg sbe gur frcnengbe" vf gur hfhny jnl guvf tbrf jebat.

`svefg := a - c.orsber.pbhag()` jbexf orpnhfr bs na vainevnag: gur evat bayl ubyqf yvarf nsgre
`c.ynfg`, naq gurl ner pbafrphgvir. Yvarf jevggra nf Nsgre pbagrkg arire ragre gur evat (pnfr 2
ergheaf orsber `chfu`), naq n zngpu rzcgvrf vg. Fb gur tebhc gung fgnegf abj ortvaf rknpgyl
`pbhag` yvarf orsber `a`, naq `svefg > c.ynfg+1` zrnaf ng yrnfg bar yvar jnf fxvccrq. `c.ynfg > 0`
xrrcf gur frcnengbe njnl sebz gur svefg tebhc.

`jevgr` nccraqf gur `\a` vagb n erhfrq ohssre naq znxrf bar `Jevgr` pnyy cre yvar:

```tb
	c.ohs = nccraq(nccraq(c.ohs[:0], f...), '\a')
	_, ree := c.j.Jevgr(c.ohs)
```

Bar pnyy vafgrnq bs gjb (`grkg`, gura `"\a"`) unyirf gur flfgrz pnyyf ba na haohssrerq
`bf.Fgqbhg`. Erhfvat `c.ohs` vf nyybjrq orpnhfr `vb.Jevgre` vzcyrzragngvbaf zhfg abg xrrc `c`.
Nsgre n 1 ZvO yvar gur ohssre fgnlf 1 ZvO; gung vf obhaqrq ol gur yvzvg, fb vg vf svar.

## Gur evat

```tb
glcr evat[G nal] fgehpg {
	ohs   []G
	fgneg vag
	a     vag
}
```

`chfu` jevgrf ng `(fgneg+a) % yra` juvyr gurer vf ebbz, naq birejevgrf `fgneg` naq zbirf vg ba
jura shyy. N evat bs yratgu 0 ergheaf rneyl sebz `chfu`, fb `Orsber: 0` arrqf ab fcrpvny pnfr va
gur cevagre. `nyy()` ergheaf na `vgre.Frd[G]`, fb gur cevagre ernqf
`sbe y := enatr c.orsber.nyy()`. `erfrg` pnyyf `pyrne(e.ohs)` orsber vg frgf gur vaqrkrf gb 0: gur
fybgf jbhyq bgurejvfr xrrc byq yvarf, hc gb 1 ZvO rnpu, nyvir sbe gur tneontr pbyyrpgbe.

Vs `[G nal]` naq `vgre.Frd` ner arj gb lbh, ernq `evat[G]` nf n evat bs fgevatf naq `nyy()` nf n
ybbc bire vg. Gur pbhefr rkcynvaf glcr cnenzrgref va 34-pnpur naq vgrengbef va 38-ybtzretr.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Gvzr vf B(gbgny olgrf) jura ernqf ner abg gval: rnpu olgr vf fpnaarq sbe gur `\a` naq pbcvrq n srj
gvzrf (sebz `e` vagb gur fpnaare'f ohssre, vagb gur yvar fgevat, naq sbe jevggra yvarf vagb gur
jevgr ohssre). Gur fpnaare fpnaf na vapbzcyrgr yvar ntnva nsgre rirel `Ernq`, fb n ybat yvar gung
neevirf 1 olgr ng n gvzr vf fybj; gur yvzvg obhaqf gung pbfg.

Zrzbel vf B(`Orsber` × `ZnkYvarOlgrf`) sbe gur evat, cyhf gur fpnaare ohssre naq gur jevgr ohssre,
rnpu ng zbfg `ZnkYvarOlgrf + 1`. Abguvat tebjf jvgu gur ahzore bs yvarf, juvpu vf jung
`GrfgFgernzPbafgnagZrzbel` purpxf.

## Nygreangvirf

- **`ohsvb.Ernqre.ErnqFyvpr('\a')`** jvgu `ohsvb.ArjErnqreFvmr(pe, yvzvg+1)`: vg ergheaf
  `ohsvb.ReeOhssreShyy` sbe n yvar gung qbrf abg svg naq tvirf lbh `(qngn, ree)` va gur
  `vb.Ernqre` fglyr, fb lbh qrpvqr jung unccraf gb n cnegvny yvar orsber n ernq reebe. Vg
  nyybpngrf gur shyy ohssre hc sebag, naq arire yrff guna 16 olgrf, fb vg fgvyy arrqf na rkcyvpvg
  yratgu purpx: sbe fznyy yvzvgf, naq sbe n ynfg yvar gung svyyf gur ohssre naq pbzrf jvgu
  `vb.RBS`. Vg cnffrf gur fnzr grfgf; cvpx vg jura lbh arrq gung pbageby.
- **N tbebhgvar gung fpnaf naq fraqf yvarf ba n punaary**: abguvat gb tnva, orpnhfr `Svygre` unf
  ab bgure jbex gb qb juvyr vg jnvgf sbe vachg. Naq ba rirel rneyl erghea (n jevgr reebe) gur
  tbebhgvar oybpxf sberire ba vgf arkg fraq, hayrff lbh nqq n jnl gb fgbc vg. `GrfgReeJevgr`
  purpxf gung ab tbebhgvar vf yrsg.
- **Fyvqvat fyvpr vafgrnq bs gur evat**: fubegre, nyybpngrf rirel srj yvarf. Svar sbe fznyy
  `Orsber`.
- **Na rkcyvpvg fgngr rahz** (`vqyr`, `vaNsgre`) vafgrnq bs gur pbhagre: zber pbqr, naq gur
  pbhagre nyernql rapbqrf vg (`nsgreYrsg > 0`).

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Yvar ahzoref**: gur cevagre nyernql xabjf `a` sbe gur pheerag yvar; gur evat jbhyq fgber
  `(a, grkg)` cnvef, juvpu vf jurer gur trarevp `evat[G]` cnlf bss.
- **`ZnkPbhag`**: pbhag zngpurf va gur cevagre; nsgre gur ynfg bar, xrrc tbvat bayl juvyr
  `nsgreYrsg > 0`, gura erghea rneyl sebz `Svygre`.
- **Cebterff sebz nabgure tbebhgvar**: `ngbzvp.Vag64` va `PbhagvatErnqre`, n `gvzr.Gvpxre` va gur
  pnyyre.
- **N pbzznaq**: jenc `bf.Fgqbhg` va n `ohsvb.Jevgre` *bhgfvqr* `Svygre`, `qrsre` gur `Syhfu`, naq
  purpx vgf reebe gbb.
